# Installed skills. `.agents` above covers where the CLI puts the files, but it also
# symlinks them into `.claude/skills/`, which that rule does not reach — so a skill
# installed into this project would have walked into a public repository through here.
.claude/skills/

# Working copies of the icons kept aside while the themed logos were being made.
assets/icons/backup-old/

# Zips
*.zip

# The private half of the development signing key. Its public half is the `key` field
# in manifest.json, which is what pins the unpacked extension to one ID
# (phfhghnjjimkbbmfjcjgaegjombeophi) instead of a new one per machine — that ID is named
# in the payment site's frame-ancestors, so it has to stay stable. The public half is
# meant to be committed; this half signs, so it is not, and the remote is public.
dev-key.pem
